{"unit_id":"simmon-clap__dsh-intelligent-ui#card-zh","repo":"simmon-clap/dsh-intelligent-ui","commit":"60f22c7967879cb82b436092037760ec249f312a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Intelligent UI 是 DeepSeek Harness 的 Web 插件，通过注册 render_ui 工具并在对话中渲染持久卡片，把结构化回答变成可读、可点击的界面。它支持表格、图表、时间线、地图、表单、按钮和折叠面板，也能在生成过程中逐步显示内容。适合需要呈现行程、方案对比、数据或收集用户选择的场景。使用地图时会从 OpenStreetMap 加载地图瓦片；其他功能不需额外密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:44-95","src/client-entry.mjs:221-250","src/catalog.mjs:19-190","src/renderer.mjs:896-1103"]}
{"unit_id":"simmon-clap__dsh-intelligent-ui#card-en","repo":"simmon-clap/dsh-intelligent-ui","commit":"60f22c7967879cb82b436092037760ec249f312a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Intelligent UI turns structured answers into interactive chat cards through render_ui. It supports tables, charts, timelines, maps, forms, buttons, and collapsible panels. Cards appear during generation and persist after the turn. Maps load OpenStreetMap tiles; other features need no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:44-95","src/client-entry.mjs:221-250","src/catalog.mjs:19-190","src/renderer.mjs:896-1103"]}
